-1 WATERDEEP~ 
{140}Waterdeep{300} 
{110}---------{300} 
{140}Waterdeep, also known as the City of Splendours is a coastal town 
on the Sword Coast north of Tethyr.  It is a city full of shops 
that would cater to anyone's needs.  It hosts a branch of the 
Griffon Bank and Travel.  The area contains {100}4{140} quests.{300}

An Adventurer's guild token has been added to this area.
 
{140}Area created by{300} {170}Blythe{140}. 
 
{140}Last Updated 17th January 1998{300} 
 
     {140}(a){300} {150}Blythe{300} 
     {140}(b){300} {150}Waterdeep Quests{300} 
     {140}(c){300} {150}Waterdeep Temples and Faiths{300} 
 
