-1 WDQUESTS~ 
{110}Quests in Waterdeep 
 
{110}*{140}The first quest will give you level 10 leveling gear.  For it 
 you need to hone your sewing skills.{300} 
{110}*{140}The second quest starts with the Merchant Thann.  It yields level 
 60 mana/ac gear.{300} 
{110}*{140}The third quest will require you getting in to see Blackstaff 
 and gives you level 80 mana/ac gear. {300}
{110}*{140}The fourth quest requires that you to go see Jonathon the
Armourer.  It yields level 70 damage gear.{300}

Type help blackstaff for more information on Blackstaff.
~ 
-1 WDTEMPLES~ 
The existing temples and faiths in Waterdeep are: 
 
{140}Temple of Mystra    - {150}Illusionists and Necromancers 
{140}Temple of Cyric     - {150}Rogues 
{140}Temple of Chauntea  - {150}Elementalists 
{140}Temple of Bhaal     - {150}Assassins 
{140}Waterdeep Barracks  - {150}Priest of Tyr - Warriors/Rangers 
{140}Temple of Mielikki  - {150}Rangers 
{140}Temple of Sune      - {150}Monks 
 
At any of these temples one can worship their faith, hone skills 
and find out about magical areas such as Faerdale. 
~ 
-1 BLACKSTAFF~
Blackstaff equipment requires that you have completed the Merchant Guild
Quest whereby you have gained his trust.  You then kill Adon of Sune for
a Token of Sune by which you gain admittance to Blackstaff's Tower.
The character who has done the above must get the death blow in order
to get Blackstaff's equipment.  Currently Blackstaff has about 20,000
hps and does 100 hand to hand damage and casts spells at level 120.
There are 4 bits of Blackstaff equipment.  It is level 84, ac18, 120 mana,
and -9 damroll.  There is a ring, robe, bracelet and boots.

Note that Blackstaff's Tower is no rip and room solitary.
~
0 $~ 
 
#RANGES 50 80 0 99
#FLAGS AFLAG_NODEBUG
#MOBILES 
#8000 
danilothannmob thann~ 
Danilo Thann~ 
Danilo Thann gives you a wicked grin. ~ 
He is a handsome man, dressed to the hilt in the finest of clothes. 
He is from one of the most wealthy families of Waterdeep. 
Actually he looks like a bit of a dandy. ~ 
ACT_SMART|ACT_SENTINEL|ACT_NO_ORDER|ACT_BODY 
AFF_TONGUES|AFF_UNDERSTAND 
0 S 
1 BODY_HAND BODY_FOOT 10d10+8000 1d10+165 
10000 RACE_HUMAN 
POS_STANDING POS_STANDING SEX_MALE 
>all_greet_prog 100~ 
if sex($n) == 2 
  mpechoat $n You have entered an all male domain! 
  mpechoat $n Danilo gives you an astonished look. 
  mpechoaround $n Danilo stares in amazement at $n. 
  mpechoat $n Danilo takes you gently by the arm and escorts you to to door. 
  mpechoaround $n Danilo escorts $n to the door. 
  say I am sorry my dear, but this is not the place for a Lady such as yourself. 
  mptransfer $n 8061 
else 
  if sex($n) == 1 
    say Welcome Sir, what can we do for you? 
  else 
    say Well I surely don't know what you are but you are not welcome here. 
    mpechoat $n The guards come to escort you away. 
    mpechoaround $n The guards come to escort $n away.
    mpmset $n long (IT) $n is here.
    mptransfer $n 8001 
    say Well I sure don't know what IT was! 
  endif 
endif 
~ 
| 
#8001 
miranda mistress~ 
Mistress Miranda~ 
Mistress Miranda smiles attends to a lady here. ~ 
She is a beautiful woman, with immaculate hair, and wonderfully dressed in 
pink silk.  Her complexion is delicate, and her eyes a clear blue. 
~ 
ACT_BODY|ACT_SMART|ACT_SENTINEL|ACT_NO_ORDER 
AFF_UNDERSTAND|AFF_TONGUES 
0 S 
1 BODY_HAND BODY_FOOT 10d10+8000 1d10+165 
10000 RACE_HUMAN 
POS_STANDING POS_STANDING SEX_FEMALE 
>all_greet_prog 100~ 
if sex($n) == 1 
  scream $n 
  shout $n is a perverted scoundrel! 
  mpmset $n long (SCOUNDREL) $n is here. 
  emote calls for the guards. 
  mpechoat $n The Waterdeep Guard arrives and escorts you out at great haste. 
  mpechoaround $n The Waterdeep Guard grabs $n and roughly escorts him out. 
  mpechoat $n You are thrown out of the Waterdeep gates. 
  mpechoat $n You land on your butt with a clatter of armour. 
  mptransfer $n 8065 
  mptransfer waterdeeptowerguard 8065 
else 
  if sex($n) == 2 
    say Welcome my Lady, how may I serve you? 
  else 
    mpechoat $n Mistress Miranda gives you an odd look. 
    mpechoaround $n Mistress Miranda gives $n an odd look. 
    say Well I know we certainly don't serve your kind.  Kindly leave. 
    mpmload 8002 
    mpechoat $n A Waterdeep Tower Guard escorts you away with a look of distaste on his face. 
    mpechoaround $n A Waterdeep Tower Guard escorts $n away with a look of distaste on his face. 
    mpmset $n long (NEUTER) $n is here. 
    mptransfer $n 8065 
    mptransfer waterdeeptowerguard 8065 
  endif 
endif 
~ 
| 
