#8007 
jonathon armourer~ 
Jonathon the Armourer~ 
Jonathon the Armourer spits on a breastplate before polishing it. ~ 
Dressed in a light scale mail, he looks like he would wear his armour 
to bed.  He offers a wide range of equipment for the warrior. 
~ 
ACT_BODY|ACT_SMART|ACT_SENTINEL|ACT_NO_ORDER 
AFF_UNDERSTAND|AFF_TONGUES 
0 S 
1 BODY_HAND BODY_FOOT 10d10+8000 1d10+165 
10000 RACE_HUMAN 
POS_STANDING POS_STANDING SEX_MALE
>rand_prog 10~
if quest(10, 4, $n) == 0
  sniff
  say I am sick and tired of this Merchant's Guild!!
  say Hey $n, you wouldn't be interested in helping me
  say out, would you?
endif
~
>speech_prog yes yeah yep ok~
if quest(10, 4, $n) == 1
  say Thank you!  I will reward you well for your
  say help.
  mpecho Jonathon pulls out a book labeled "ORDERS" and opens it.
  say Well I had a customer in here the other day.
  say He was telling me he really wanted a
  say Shield of the Winter Wolf.
  say Get me one of those and I will be extremely grateful.
  mpmset $n quest 10 4 2
else
  say See its like this.  The Merchant's Guild is
  say slowly putting me out of business.  They
  say sell my best stock at a discount! I cant
  say compete with them.  I need someone to
  say get for me stock that they don't sell
  say at the guild.  Still interested in helping
  say me?
  mpmset $n quest 10 4 1
endif
~
>give_prog i5731~
if quest(10, 4, $n) == 2
  mpecho Jonathon grabs a rag and starts to polish the shield.
  say This will do nicely!
  say While you were gone I had another order.
  say An adventurer in town for a short time is
  say in need of a pink bracer.
  mpecho Jonathon turns back to polishing his shield assuming you will get him what he asks.
  mpmset $n quest 10 4 3
  mpjunk i5731
endif
~
>give_prog i15148~
if quest(10, 4, $n) == 3
  mpecho Jonathon holds the bracer to the light.
  say Hmmm it sure is pink.  Don't see the attraction
  say in pink armour personally but this is what the
  say man wants and hes willing to pay good money for
  say it!
  say The man who ordered the shield was impressed
  say with me for getting it so promptly.  You and
  say I are making a good partnership here!
  say He wants a Red Kilt now.  Seems he has a thing
  say for showing off his legs!
  mpecho Jonathon spits on the bracer and starts to buff it up with a rag.
  mpmset $n quest 10 4 4
  mpjunk i15148
endif
~
>give_prog i7504~
if quest(10, 4, $n) == 4
  mpecho Jonathon shakes out the kilt and lays it on the counter in front of him.
  say Hmmmm a bit of a blood stain here.
  say Looks like you had to kill someone for this.
  say Never to mind my wife will give it a wash
  say and the buyer will be none the wiser.
  say I am building up a reputation for being
  say able to get hard to come by items!
  say Its great for business!
  say I have an order here for Questor's Ring.
  mpmset $n quest 10 4 5
  mpjunk i7504
endif
~
>give_prog i15013~
if quest(10, 4, $n) == 5
  mpecho Jonathon holds up the ring to the light.
  say Its very worn.  Well the buyer doesn't want
  say it for its looks.  It is said to have
  say magical qualities.
  say I have an order here for a Chain Hauberk
  say from the Moonshae Islands.
  mpmset $n quest 10 4 6
  mpjunk ii15013
endif
~
>give_prog i219~
if quest(10, 4, $n) == 6
  mpecho With a clatter of metal Jonathon places the Hauberk onto the counter.
  say Hmmm this is in very good order.
  say Either you were careful when you
  say killed the owner or you found this
  say in another shop.  Personally I don't
  say care where you get it.  Its worth good
  say money to me here.
  say Hmm one final thing I want you to get me.
  say I need an Agenothree tank.
  mpmset $n quest 10 4 7
  mpjunk i219
endif
~
>give_prog i5609~
if quest(10, 4, $n) == 7
  mpecho There is a sloshing noise as Jonathon places the tank on the counter.
  say Interesting armour!
  say Well I am very appreciative of your help.
  say Profits are booming and I have more
  say customers than I ever have!
  say I have made these especially for you.
  say They should fit you well.
  mpoload 8085
  mpoload 8086
  give i8085 $n
  give i8086 $n
  mpmset $n long $n of Waterdeep Armourer's is here.
  mpmset $n quest 10 4 8
  mpjunk i5609
endif
~
