    say You must be hungry. 
    emote utters some strange words and moves his hands. 
    mpquiet on 
    cast feast 
    mpquiet off 
    emote places a fine feast of food before you and you eat your fill. 
    emote returns to his studies. 
    mpmset $r quest 0 5 7 
