#8000 
Sword Coast~ 
You can see Waterdeep to the East.  Its size and magnificence 
stun you.  To your west is the Sea of Swords.  The sea of 
swords is dotted here and there with sails of cargo ships. 
You are on a steep coast line atop of which is a steep wall, 
dotted at regular intervals with sturdy towers.  It is broken 
only in the centre of the escarpment , where the cliff is so 
tall and steep that no man can possibly scale it. 
~ 
