#8094 
Temple of Chauntea~ 
Beautiful tapestries hang from the walls, depicting pastoral scenes. 
Pots with plants are placed around the temple.  Chauntea is a goddess 
of the hearth and nature.  This would be the place where Druids would 
come to worship when in Waterdeep.~ 
